---
import OverlayMockup from './OverlayMockup.astro';
---

<section id="how" class="py-20 md:py-28" aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <div class="container-page grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center lg:gap-16">
    <div class="lg:col-span-5" data-reveal>
      <p class="edge-code">01 · 怎麼用</p>
      <h2 id="how-title" class="section-title">三個動作，<br /><span class="hl">留下這一刻</span>。</h2>
      <ol class="mt-10 space-y-8">
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step-no mono" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="step-title">按 <kbd>⌥⇧N</kbd>，或點「記下這一刻」</h3>
            <p class="step-body">
              在播放頁按快捷鍵；滑鼠一動，頁面上也會浮出「記下這一刻」按鈕。擴充功能先截圖、再暫停影片。
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step-no mono" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="step-title">畫面、秒數、台詞自動帶入</h3>
            <p class="step-body">
              小視窗帶入這一刻的截圖、片名與秒數，台詞讀自字幕，也可以自己改。哪一項沒抓到，小視窗會直接列出來。
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step-no mono" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="step-title">寫下心得，<kbd>Enter</kbd> 存檔</h3>
            <p class="step-body">
              存檔後影片繼續播；<kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>Enter</kbd> 換行，<kbd>Esc</kbd> 取消。心得可以留空，事後再補。中文輸入法選字的
              Enter 不算存檔。
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <div class="lg:col-span-7" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 0.1s">
      <OverlayMockup />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .step {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2.75rem 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .step-no {
    padding-top: 0.2rem;
    color: var(--color-amber);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--color-amber);
    width: fit-content;
    height: fit-content;
  }
  .step-title {
    word-break: keep-all;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    font-size: 1.1875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .step-body {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-300);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .step kbd {
    font-size: 0.85em;
  }
</style>
